# rwai-bench observation template (replay_verified, PROJ-614/616): one per
# workflow set whose replay re-manufacture reproduced the recorded POWL
# digest byte-identically (or refused identically for refused sets).
# {{DIGEST}} is the content-derived BLAKE3 digest the replay reproduced —
# nothing time-based enters any digest. The ocel-replays.construct.rq
# CONSTRUCT projects this fact into the OCEL evidence graph as an event
# carrying the `replay.verified` attribute that metric-replay.rq counts.
# Vocabulary: crates/praxis-graphlaw/ontologies/core/bench-obs.ttl + ex:.
@prefix ex:  <http://example.org/rwai#> .
@prefix obs: <https://ggen.io/ontology/bench-obs#> .

ex:{{SUBJECT}} a obs:Observation ;
  obs:obsKind "replay_verified" ;
  obs:obsSeq {{SEQ}} ;
  obs:obsSetId "{{SET_ID}}" ;
  obs:obsDigest "{{DIGEST}}" .
